traight line that passes through all three of these points.\n\n![](images/f5/f52592db0fee86e26318d6d2de9d7f685f1fb9f5d416628a04878857f1c54b54.png)\n\n- Diagram II shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](images/76/76f0da764caf0237a2d30d32d593886d8df6c348368fe889f7447be781b6faf1.png)\n\n- Diagram III shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.\n\n![](images/97/9778abd955cdc9b705800eba8f3d0d635af1c6a5fd5724583bdb32a943c6d44f.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531655 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186531555 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531655 #edb/ref 1069 "q-155051" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531655 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531655 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/01/01aba7550fb134b1f3a93276dc8f3b91794844ea21254c2c75a0702a443a60e3.png)\n\nWhich of the diagrams above shows three collinear points?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531655 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f44be398-7e63-5657-97ac-ad7b78dba187" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531655 #edb/ref 1074 "Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.\n\n- Diagram I shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.\n\n![](images/63/6310ff39996be529bc44e5058ef9710400f0c8089196a57e7f4eb541703e53ae.png)\n\n- Diagram II shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](images/63/6334d2bc1fda6390b6ec542afb8cc37d4f76322b98d41ca6bbb3af3c8d735c8f.png)\n\n- Diagram III shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](images/89/8939cff2d7cc8ca9a08c7be63517ffb900e49b769edc5c2454119f4da25904cc.png)\n\n \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531676 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2a5c9c16-0e21-58e2-96cf-f2e548e46cfb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531676 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186531655 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531680 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186531693 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531680 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "31152b20-4269-5712-98a1-7b73a2698d69" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531680 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186111394 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531693 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186531676 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531693 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "765a5c07-dcf7-5bfa-9917-01071a277a0b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186531693 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186531608 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
